(6696360, 1001261, 43774, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! I like that you filled the frame and the focus and detail are great. It seems a bit washed out to me, is this HDR?</td>', 'Wonderful! I like that you filled the frame and the focus and detail are great. It seems a bit washed out to me, is this HDR?', '2012-03-01 08:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696361, 1001614, 43774, '<td valign="top">Haha very cute.</td>', 'Haha very cute.', '2012-03-01 08:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696362, 1001494, 99263, '<td valign="top">Striking capture of this vulture.  Works extremely well in this particular sepia tone.. very nice processing. Lovely dof. 8</td>', 'Striking capture of this vulture.  Works extremely well in this particular sepia tone.. very nice processing. Lovely dof. 8', '2012-03-01 08:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696363, 1000960, 15711, '<td valign="top">Your title is the perfect description.</td>', 'Your title is the perfect description.', '2012-03-01 08:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696364, 1001616, 15711, '<td valign="top">This made me smile.  I love the movement and the diagonal shadow. ;) 7</td>', 'This made me smile.  I love the movement and the diagonal shadow. ;) 7', '2012-03-01 08:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696366, 1001877, 99263, '<td valign="top">Almost mystical. That small cloud of smoke from the chimneys on the right looks like some levitating or flying entity of some kind giving the whole scene an almost Dali like surrealism.<br/>Nice B&amp;W processing and wonderful light and contrast.</td>', 'Almost mystical. That small cloud of smoke from the chimneys on the right looks like some levitating or flying entity of some kind giving the whole scene an almost Dali like surrealism.Nice B&W processing and wonderful light and contrast.', '2012-03-01 08:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696367, 998533, 15711, '<td valign="top">Terrific.  I like the hint of green.</td>', 'Terrific.  I like the hint of green.', '2012-03-01 08:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696368, 1001820, 43774, '<td valign="top">I read your title and then looked and looked for the poacifier and couldn''t see it. Then I thought maybe there was no pacifier and you meant a person (a pacifist). Then I saw the pacifier and realized I had seen it all along, but in my mind I saw an upside down mask!<br/> <br/>This is quite an intriguing photo. Is it lying in weeds/seeds or feathers from a dead bird? What are those 2 white spiky things? <br/> <br/>Is it art? I don''t know but it''s made me think.</td>', 'I read your title and then looked and looked for the poacifier and couldn''t see it. Then I thought maybe there was no pacifier and you meant a person (a pacifist). Then I saw the pacifier and realized I had seen it all along, but in my mind I saw an upside down mask! This is quite an intriguing photo. Is it lying in weeds/seeds or feathers from a dead bird? What are those 2 white spiky things?  Is it art? I don''t know but it''s made me think.', '2012-03-01 08:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696370, 1000834, 15711, '<td valign="top">I wish somehow his face could have been illuminated.  I love the misty fog. ;)</td>', 'I wish somehow his face could have been illuminated.  I love the misty fog. ;)', '2012-03-01 08:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696372, 1001681, 43774, '<td valign="top">What a great winter beach scene! Love the sweep of the sand and grasses. No idea what that yellow thing is but it looks neat.</td>', 'What a great winter beach scene! Love the sweep of the sand and grasses. No idea what that yellow thing is but it looks neat.', '2012-03-01 08:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
