(6696414, 1001795, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is just awesome.  Loving all of the dog entries. Aren''t you?</td>', 'This is just awesome.  Loving all of the dog entries. Aren''t you?', '2012-03-01 08:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696416, 1001625, 15711, '<td valign="top">We should rename it the dog challenge.  I love it.  (I entered one too)  This is a great portrait.  Love the catch lights.</td>', 'We should rename it the dog challenge.  I love it.  (I entered one too)  This is a great portrait.  Love the catch lights.', '2012-03-01 08:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696417, 999784, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is amazing!!!!!</td>', 'This is amazing!!!!!', '2012-03-01 08:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696419, 998534, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love the bokeh.  What would have sent it over the top for me would be a catch light in his eye.  Nice going. :)</td>', 'Love the bokeh.  What would have sent it over the top for me would be a catch light in his eye.  Nice going. :)', '2012-03-01 08:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696420, 1001547, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh this is spectacular.</td>', 'Oh this is spectacular.', '2012-03-01 08:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696421, 1000456, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love this.  Like your title too. ;)</td>', 'I love this.  Like your title too. ;)', '2012-03-01 08:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696430, 1000906, 144477, '<td valign="top">There are a few things a little off in this photograph in my opinion. It seems to be a little soft and a bit over-processed. I also think the composition needs some work as all the lines in the image are not working in harmony with the angle that you chose to take the photo at. A slight adjustment in your physical position would have made a big difference. i.e. the window on the left adds nothing at all to the image and is in fact distracting. I would have repositioned my body and adjusted my composition to create more impact.</td>', 'There are a few things a little off in this photograph in my opinion. It seems to be a little soft and a bit over-processed. I also think the composition needs some work as all the lines in the image are not working in harmony with the angle that you chose to take the photo at. A slight adjustment in your physical position would have made a big difference. i.e. the window on the left adds nothing at all to the image and is in fact distracting. I would have repositioned my body and adjusted my composition to create more impact.', '2012-03-01 08:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696433, 1001845, 144477, '<td valign="top">The composition of this picture is really well done. The silhouette of the tree and ground, draws your eye to the subtle detail of the moon and from there it flows to the ice pile on the left. Basically your eye is drawn through the entire shot which means you are looking at it for a longer period of time. Great job!</td>', 'The composition of this picture is really well done. The silhouette of the tree and ground, draws your eye to the subtle detail of the moon and from there it flows to the ice pile on the left. Basically your eye is drawn through the entire shot which means you are looking at it for a longer period of time. Great job!', '2012-03-01 08:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696435, 1001864, 144477, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely photograph and something a little different than the average flower shot. I do wish that the focus of the picture (the green end of the petal) was just a tad sharper.</td>', 'This is a lovely photograph and something a little different than the average flower shot. I do wish that the focus of the picture (the green end of the petal) was just a tad sharper.', '2012-03-01 08:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696439, 998513, 144477, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, although I might have cropped a bit more at the top to make the flower less in the center. I also think it would have helped make the darker areas of the background in the upper left hand corner a little less distracting. The bit that is coming down in a point towards the flower is catching my eye and pulling my attention away from the flower, not what you want your background bokeh to do.</td>', 'I like the composition, although I might have cropped a bit more at the top to make the flower less in the center. I also think it would have helped make the darker areas of the background in the upper left hand corner a little less distracting. The bit that is coming down in a point towards the flower is catching my eye and pulling my attention away from the flower, not what you want your background bokeh to do.', '2012-03-01 09:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696443, 1001892, 144477, '<td valign="top">It works. It definitely works. The seagull is perfectly placed in the light part of the water, with the dark aspects complimenting that placement and he definitely draws your eye. I might have cropped the image a bit more to place the seagull a little more in the lines of the traditional rule of thirds (lower left section) because I think with this particular shot that rule would have applied quite well. (I don''t often say that)</td>', 'It works. It definitely works. The seagull is perfectly placed in the light part of the water, with the dark aspects complimenting that placement and he definitely draws your eye. I might have cropped the image a bit more to place the seagull a little more in the lines of the traditional rule of thirds (lower left section) because I think with this particular shot that rule would have applied quite well. (I don''t often say that)', '2012-03-01 09:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696444, 1001840, 99263, '<td valign="top">Cool. Well seen, captured and presented.</td>', 'Cool. Well seen, captured and presented.', '2012-03-01 09:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696446, 1001850, 99263, '<td valign="top">Really cool in the pool</td>', 'Really cool in the pool', '2012-03-01 09:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696447, 1001206, 99263, '<td valign="top">Lovely B&amp;W portrait. Nice lighting and smooth skin tones.</td>', 'Lovely B&W portrait. Nice lighting and smooth skin tones.', '2012-03-01 09:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696449, 1001690, 144477, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail, not only is the heron perfectly captured but the love the fish right below his foot. The coloring of the background makes the bird pop. About the only thing I would have changed is the crop. I would have done a tight crop of the left side to his body and added some additional space on the right side. Effectively moving the bulk of the bird out of the center of the shot, but putting his stunning head in a better place and really emphasizing the angle of his beak.</td>', 'Excellent detail, not only is the heron perfectly captured but the love the fish right below his foot. The coloring of the background makes the bird pop. About the only thing I would have changed is the crop. I would have done a tight crop of the left side to his body and added some additional space on the right side. Effectively moving the bulk of the bird out of the center of the shot, but putting his stunning head in a better place and really emphasizing the angle of his beak.', '2012-03-01 09:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696452, 1000707, 144477, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Great composition, the bridge really pulls your eye in and leads you to the gorgeous parts of the sky. The only change I would have made is to make the bridge a bit sharper, I think a harder line would have been a great contrast to the soft sky. Understandably that might have been tricky to do with this setting and still get the soft water / sky.</td>', 'Very nice. Great composition, the bridge really pulls your eye in and leads you to the gorgeous parts of the sky. The only change I would have made is to make the bridge a bit sharper, I think a harder line would have been a great contrast to the soft sky. Understandably that might have been tricky to do with this setting and still get the soft water / sky.', '2012-03-01 09:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696458, 1001056, 144477, '<td valign="top">I really, really like this shot and looked at it for quite a while. The composition is excellent, with the opposite angles of the roots and the hills behind. The snow is blown out and there isn''t much detail there which sorta works, but I''m curious what a bit of detail might have done to the shot. The texture of the roots looks to be a little soft as well. Was this handheld? I''d love to see this one blown up as I think a much larger scale would enhance the beauty. Definitely not an easy shot to take outdoors in falling snow.</td>', 'I really, really like this shot and looked at it for quite a while. The composition is excellent, with the opposite angles of the roots and the hills behind. The snow is blown out and there isn''t much detail there which sorta works, but I''m curious what a bit of detail might have done to the shot. The texture of the roots looks to be a little soft as well. Was this handheld? I''d love to see this one blown up as I think a much larger scale would enhance the beauty. Definitely not an easy shot to take outdoors in falling snow.', '2012-03-01 09:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696460, 1000227, 144477, '<td valign="top">Great composition, almost looks like the start of a deer totem pole. It works, and adds a lot of interest to an already great capture. I think you have an excellent photograph here and you should be pretty darned pleased with yourself.</td>', 'Great composition, almost looks like the start of a deer totem pole. It works, and adds a lot of interest to an already great capture. I think you have an excellent photograph here and you should be pretty darned pleased with yourself.', '2012-03-01 09:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696462, 1001877, 144477, '<td valign="top">There are some really interesting elements to this picture that cause your eye to roam around the image and take it all in. Between the tree silhouette, the people, the sun and the smoke tower, there is a lot going on. However, if you take any one of the four out, I think the picture would have a lot less impact. An unusual composition, but in this case I think it works.</td>', 'There are some really interesting elements to this picture that cause your eye to roam around the image and take it all in. Between the tree silhouette, the people, the sun and the smoke tower, there is a lot going on. However, if you take any one of the four out, I think the picture would have a lot less impact. An unusual composition, but in this case I think it works.', '2012-03-01 09:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696467, 1001592, 144477, '<td valign="top">My mark on this photo is basically down to the fact that there is nothing capturing my eye here. What exactly is intended to draw my eye into this picture? These records had some great potential, but you took the most obvious angle (shot) of them. What was your creative intent? What were you trying to say to the viewer? As is, it''s just a picture. Try changing it up, moving your body around, look for different angles, look beyond the obvious. A closeup angles to the side of one of these and a shallow DOF would have been interesting, as just one example.</td>', 'My mark on this photo is basically down to the fact that there is nothing capturing my eye here. What exactly is intended to draw my eye into this picture? These records had some great potential, but you took the most obvious angle (shot) of them. What was your creative intent? What were you trying to say to the viewer? As is, it''s just a picture. Try changing it up, moving your body around, look for different angles, look beyond the obvious. A closeup angles to the side of one of these and a shallow DOF would have been interesting, as just one example.', '2012-03-01 09:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696471, 1001806, 144477, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, the use of colour and light. The unfortunate detail for me is that it looks like your focus was more on the front foot area of the dragon and not so much on his head. A tricky shot because of the macro nature of it, but I would have focused on his eye, made that area sharp, and let the flame be a burst of light to the side as it is now.</td>', 'I like the composition, the use of colour and light. The unfortunate detail for me is that it looks like your focus was more on the front foot area of the dragon and not so much on his head. A tricky shot because of the macro nature of it, but I would have focused on his eye, made that area sharp, and let the flame be a burst of light to the side as it is now.', '2012-03-01 09:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696472, 1001793, 116575, '<td valign="top">lovely, glad its doing well :)</td>', 'lovely, glad its doing well :)', '2012-03-01 09:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696476, 1001846, 144477, '<td valign="top">I''m curious as to why you chose to go the B&amp;W route? I think the green on the wings would have been great to see in this shot. I also think as a B&amp;W the overall exposure is a little too dark, the white on the wings leaps out at you because it is blown out, but the actual ducks sorta blend.</td>', 'I''m curious as to why you chose to go the B&W route? I think the green on the wings would have been great to see in this shot. I also think as a B&W the overall exposure is a little too dark, the white on the wings leaps out at you because it is blown out, but the actual ducks sorta blend.', '2012-03-01 09:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696479, 1001759, 144477, '<td valign="top">Great focus and composition. The only thing I find distracting is the shadows on the hands and her sweater. Adding just a little bit of under light, or some closer to your right side would have eliminated much of this strong shadowing. It distracts from her hands, and given that is where her focus is, it makes you look there first as well.</td>', 'Great focus and composition. The only thing I find distracting is the shadows on the hands and her sweater. Adding just a little bit of under light, or some closer to your right side would have eliminated much of this strong shadowing. It distracts from her hands, and given that is where her focus is, it makes you look there first as well.', '2012-03-01 09:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696480, 1000126, 69368, '<td valign="top">wonderful moody athmosphere</td>', 'wonderful moody athmosphere', '2012-03-01 09:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696483, 997224, 144477, '<td valign="top">I find the colour cast on this photo to be really off putting. Not sure if this was done in processing, or in camera, but the colours are definitely off. The wood has a purple tone, the snow is too blue and the tree branches look unnaturally green. Is it possible you monitor is not calibrated correctly? Do you saturate this image?</td>', 'I find the colour cast on this photo to be really off putting. Not sure if this was done in processing, or in camera, but the colours are definitely off. The wood has a purple tone, the snow is too blue and the tree branches look unnaturally green. Is it possible you monitor is not calibrated correctly? Do you saturate this image?', '2012-03-01 09:47:39.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6696484, 1000862, 69368, '<td valign="top">really nice capture. Great nature photography. Reminds me to [user]54446[/user]</td>', 'really nice capture. Great nature photography. Reminds me to [user]54446[/user]', '2012-03-01 09:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696486, 1001761, 144477, '<td valign="top">The colour in this photo is just stunning, the DOF and the detail on the bird near perfect. What a difficult photo to take and you have done it well. The angle and position of the bird is a little odd, but given the difficulty of shooting birds I can understand why. I think it is an interesting photo, and it definitely grabs your attention, partially because it is so unique. In this case the odd works for you!</td>', 'The colour in this photo is just stunning, the DOF and the detail on the bird near perfect. What a difficult photo to take and you have done it well. The angle and position of the bird is a little odd, but given the difficulty of shooting birds I can understand why. I think it is an interesting photo, and it definitely grabs your attention, partially because it is so unique. In this case the odd works for you!', '2012-03-01 09:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696487, 1000529, 69368, '<td valign="top">beauiful landscape. no need for this blue streak, IMO</td>', 'beauiful landscape. no need for this blue streak, IMO', '2012-03-01 09:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696490, 999100, 43774, '<td valign="top">Neat angle and very cool looking.</td>', 'Neat angle and very cool looking.', '2012-03-01 09:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696491, 1001887, 43774, '<td valign="top">Oh I love the ripples in the sand!!! Nice fence to break up the picture too and add interest.</td>', 'Oh I love the ripples in the sand!!! Nice fence to break up the picture too and add interest.', '2012-03-01 09:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696492, 1000420, 43774, '<td valign="top">Stunning scenery, beautiful light and reflection.</td>', 'Stunning scenery, beautiful light and reflection.', '2012-03-01 09:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696493, 1001876, 69368, '<td valign="top">this made me smile</td>', 'this made me smile', '2012-03-01 09:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
