(6696566, 1001449, 134859, '<td valign="top">A beautiful sunset photograph.  I love taking photos with a barren tree to the side, it''s one of the things I have done since first taking pictures.  It emits beauty (in my opinion).<br/>The colors of the sunset here are beautiful.  I love the water, and the fact that the majority of the picture is composed of the sky gives a slightly off balance feel, but it works perfectly here.  Great shot!</td>', 'A beautiful sunset photograph.  I love taking photos with a barren tree to the side, it''s one of the things I have done since first taking pictures.  It emits beauty (in my opinion).The colors of the sunset here are beautiful.  I love the water, and the fact that the majority of the picture is composed of the sky gives a slightly off balance feel, but it works perfectly here.  Great shot!', '2012-03-01 10:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
