(6696572, 1001833, 134859, '<td valign="top">A very interesting photo.  The fact that most of the picture is blurred by reflections makes it that much more intriguing.  The inclusion of the lone tree trunk to the right of the frame gives that little bit of detail that is needed, in a photo that is mostly blurry.  The color choice works well.  I really like this.  It''s abstract in a way where we know what it is.  Great job.  Wonderful title.</td>', 'A very interesting photo.  The fact that most of the picture is blurred by reflections makes it that much more intriguing.  The inclusion of the lone tree trunk to the right of the frame gives that little bit of detail that is needed, in a photo that is mostly blurry.  The color choice works well.  I really like this.  It''s abstract in a way where we know what it is.  Great job.  Wonderful title.', '2012-03-01 10:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
