(6696654, 1000783, 134859, '<td valign="top">An amazing capture.  I have never seen anything like it.  This makes me want to go visit just to be able to photograph it and see it with my own eyes!  <br/> <br/>I love the simplicity of the picture.  The only critique I have is that I wish the background as a little blurred or there was more fog or something (not that you can control the fog, lol).  The industrial machines (as I am assuming those are what they are) are a bit distracting. Other than that... it''s wonderful!</td>', 'An amazing capture.  I have never seen anything like it.  This makes me want to go visit just to be able to photograph it and see it with my own eyes!   I love the simplicity of the picture.  The only critique I have is that I wish the background as a little blurred or there was more fog or something (not that you can control the fog, lol).  The industrial machines (as I am assuming those are what they are) are a bit distracting. Other than that... it''s wonderful!', '2012-03-01 11:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
