(6696656, 1001309, 134859, '<td valign="top">It took me a minute to figure out that this was reflected in the water (it is, isn''t it?).  The bubbles/things at the top of the picture are very distracting to me.  If we could see the actual waters edge, perhaps it would eliminate the confusion.  <br/> <br/>But it is very interesting in it''s composure.</td>', 'It took me a minute to figure out that this was reflected in the water (it is, isn''t it?).  The bubbles/things at the top of the picture are very distracting to me.  If we could see the actual waters edge, perhaps it would eliminate the confusion.   But it is very interesting in it''s composure.', '2012-03-01 11:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696657, 1001868, 134859, '<td valign="top">This looks less like an actual photograph due to the over processing, I would have liked to had seen it a little less processed and a little more realistic.  However, that being said... it''s still an awesome photo and great processing work.</td>', 'This looks less like an actual photograph due to the over processing, I would have liked to had seen it a little less processed and a little more realistic.  However, that being said... it''s still an awesome photo and great processing work.', '2012-03-01 11:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696658, 999138, 144477, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderfully composed photo. The light golden colour of the hill in contrast to the moody sky and foreground, combined with the upwards angle of the hill completely draws your eye in. The only odd thing seems to be the clouds, for whatever reason they look a little off to me. Did you process them a lot?</td>', 'This is a wonderfully composed photo. The light golden colour of the hill in contrast to the moody sky and foreground, combined with the upwards angle of the hill completely draws your eye in. The only odd thing seems to be the clouds, for whatever reason they look a little off to me. Did you process them a lot?', '2012-03-01 11:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696659, 1000707, 7327, '<td valign="top">Nice Shot, I like the curve of the bridge, the balance and sky.</td>', 'Nice Shot, I like the curve of the bridge, the balance and sky.', '2012-03-01 11:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
