(6696661, 1001850, 134859, '<td valign="top">A little unrealistic in the colors.  But it''s an interesting way to go about processing.  My son loves the dog in the water... he is sitting here telling me "I want a puppy like that".  So he loves the photo.  :)<br/>I also like the idea of it, the ripples in the water.  I just think it went a little overboard in the coloring.</td>', 'A little unrealistic in the colors.  But it''s an interesting way to go about processing.  My son loves the dog in the water... he is sitting here telling me "I want a puppy like that".  So he loves the photo.  :)I also like the idea of it, the ripples in the water.  I just think it went a little overboard in the coloring.', '2012-03-01 11:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
