(6697973, 1001386, 89723, '<td valign="top">Now this reminds me of the year I lived in Tokyo. I really enjoyed that time. I should add, I met my "Awesome" wife there!</td>', 'Now this reminds me of the year I lived in Tokyo. I really enjoyed that time. I should add, I met my "Awesome" wife there!', '2012-03-02 10:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698012, 1001703, 134859, '<td valign="top">I like the glow in the shot.  But I find myself coming back to it, over and over again.  There is something that isn''t quite "right" IMO.  But I can''t put my finger on it.  Don''t get me wrong, I like the shot, it''s a warming sensation... but there''s something that is throwing it off.  ?</td>', 'I like the glow in the shot.  But I find myself coming back to it, over and over again.  There is something that isn''t quite "right" IMO.  But I can''t put my finger on it.  Don''t get me wrong, I like the shot, it''s a warming sensation... but there''s something that is throwing it off.  ?', '2012-03-02 11:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698016, 1001551, 134859, '<td valign="top">A fiery feeling.  Love the different shades of oranges in this photo.  The sun shining through the tree is a good effect.  Nicely done.</td>', 'A fiery feeling.  Love the different shades of oranges in this photo.  The sun shining through the tree is a good effect.  Nicely done.', '2012-03-02 11:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698017, 1001845, 134859, '<td valign="top">A nice photo.  Seems just a little too dark for my taste, but overall, I like the detail.</td>', 'A nice photo.  Seems just a little too dark for my taste, but overall, I like the detail.', '2012-03-02 11:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698020, 1000126, 134859, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, this photo doesn''t have the wow factor for me.  It''s a nice photo, but it doesn''t scream out at me.  <br/>On the plus side... this is one that has a visually calming effect.  Which is nice when you want something like that.  :)</td>', 'Unfortunately, this photo doesn''t have the wow factor for me.  It''s a nice photo, but it doesn''t scream out at me.  On the plus side... this is one that has a visually calming effect.  Which is nice when you want something like that.  :)', '2012-03-02 11:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698021, 1001371, 134859, '<td valign="top">A little overly processed for my liking.  But it''s a nice photo.</td>', 'A little overly processed for my liking.  But it''s a nice photo.', '2012-03-02 11:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698025, 1001720, 134859, '<td valign="top">The title is fitting.  It has a cold feeling, as I am sure the blues and mist create this effect.  I really like the attention to the detail in the foreground, and way off in the distance, you can see the lights of a city/town.  It''s a very beautiful picture, executed well.</td>', 'The title is fitting.  It has a cold feeling, as I am sure the blues and mist create this effect.  I really like the attention to the detail in the foreground, and way off in the distance, you can see the lights of a city/town.  It''s a very beautiful picture, executed well.', '2012-03-02 11:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698026, 1000420, 134859, '<td valign="top">I love this.  The difference in colors, the reflection in the water... the mountains.  It''s all beautiful.  Great shot! 8</td>', 'I love this.  The difference in colors, the reflection in the water... the mountains.  It''s all beautiful.  Great shot! 8', '2012-03-02 11:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698027, 1000960, 134859, '<td valign="top">Without the title of the picture, I would have said the shot looked a little too soft.  But, with the blur on the trees, it gives a mystic feeling.</td>', 'Without the title of the picture, I would have said the shot looked a little too soft.  But, with the blur on the trees, it gives a mystic feeling.', '2012-03-02 11:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698029, 1001671, 134859, '<td valign="top">It''s a well contrasted photo.  The black and white really makes it stand out.  Nice detail and sharpness.  The clouds/fog is a great capture, as it adds that little extra something to make it special.  Great job</td>', 'It''s a well contrasted photo.  The black and white really makes it stand out.  Nice detail and sharpness.  The clouds/fog is a great capture, as it adds that little extra something to make it special.  Great job', '2012-03-02 11:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698030, 1001520, 134859, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot.  It almost doesn''t look like this is a reflection because it''s so detailed, the water is so quiet.  It''s a wonderful shot, and the color conversion works well.</td>', 'I like this a lot.  It almost doesn''t look like this is a reflection because it''s so detailed, the water is so quiet.  It''s a wonderful shot, and the color conversion works well.', '2012-03-02 11:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698032, 997624, 134859, '<td valign="top">It''s beautiful.  The different levels of black and gray.  It''s visually appealing.  Nicely done.</td>', 'It''s beautiful.  The different levels of black and gray.  It''s visually appealing.  Nicely done.', '2012-03-02 11:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698034, 1001865, 134859, '<td valign="top">At first glance, I thought this shot was too saturated in oranges.  But, after looking at it longer, I really do like the effect it gives.  Nice shot</td>', 'At first glance, I thought this shot was too saturated in oranges.  But, after looking at it longer, I really do like the effect it gives.  Nice shot', '2012-03-02 11:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698037, 1001686, 73942, '<td valign="top">love the title</td>', 'love the title', '2012-03-02 11:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698038, 1001813, 134859, '<td valign="top">This is a very mysterious shot.  It''s almost as if you cross that barbed wire fence, you won''t know what you''re walking into or off of.  It''s definitely intriguing.</td>', 'This is a very mysterious shot.  It''s almost as if you cross that barbed wire fence, you won''t know what you''re walking into or off of.  It''s definitely intriguing.', '2012-03-02 11:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698039, 1001840, 73942, '<td valign="top">wonderful shadows and so perfect with that one person standing on the balcony</td>', 'wonderful shadows and so perfect with that one person standing on the balcony', '2012-03-02 11:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698041, 1000108, 134859, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to had seen a different angle, but with the orange/yellow tones where they are, it makes me want to walk around to see what is in the crevice.  It adds that spark of interest.  Great shot</td>', 'I would have liked to had seen a different angle, but with the orange/yellow tones where they are, it makes me want to walk around to see what is in the crevice.  It adds that spark of interest.  Great shot', '2012-03-02 11:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698043, 1000529, 134859, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture.  I think the blue border is throwing it off a little, it wasn''t needed, IMO.  But the low laying clouds make for a beautiful shot.</td>', 'I really like this picture.  I think the blue border is throwing it off a little, it wasn''t needed, IMO.  But the low laying clouds make for a beautiful shot.', '2012-03-02 11:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698046, 1001681, 134859, '<td valign="top">A nice shot.  Not many people experience the beach when it is off-season time.  I like it.</td>', 'A nice shot.  Not many people experience the beach when it is off-season time.  I like it.', '2012-03-02 11:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698050, 1000987, 134859, '<td valign="top">I''m a fan of lighthouses, as I am completely intrigued by them.  I guess it''s because I''ve never gotten to actually visit a light house, and all those years I lived in North Carolina and went to the beaches/banks... never went to visit.  Makes me want to go again.  It''s definitely on my list of things to shoot.  Back to the picture.  The detail is wonderful, and the colors of the sky just enhance the photo.  Very nicely done!</td>', 'I''m a fan of lighthouses, as I am completely intrigued by them.  I guess it''s because I''ve never gotten to actually visit a light house, and all those years I lived in North Carolina and went to the beaches/banks... never went to visit.  Makes me want to go again.  It''s definitely on my list of things to shoot.  Back to the picture.  The detail is wonderful, and the colors of the sky just enhance the photo.  Very nicely done!', '2012-03-02 11:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698055, 1000447, 134859, '<td valign="top">A beautiful winter shot.  The lone barn(?) adds the interest that I look for in photos.  It''s a winter wonderland.</td>', 'A beautiful winter shot.  The lone barn(?) adds the interest that I look for in photos.  It''s a winter wonderland.', '2012-03-02 11:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698058, 997878, 2058, '<td valign="top">Looks just like Joker''s "War Face" from Full Metal Jacket! Great job!</td>', 'Looks just like Joker''s "War Face" from Full Metal Jacket! Great job!', '2012-03-02 11:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698061, 1000199, 134859, '<td valign="top">Not quite sure about the title... but I like the oddness of this photo.  The trees look deformed/strange, which makes me look even longer at the shot.  I like the greens, not overly saturated.  A nice shot.</td>', 'Not quite sure about the title... but I like the oddness of this photo.  The trees look deformed/strange, which makes me look even longer at the shot.  I like the greens, not overly saturated.  A nice shot.', '2012-03-02 11:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698066, 1001617, 134859, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of Ft. Sill, in the back areas where they were fenced off.  You would see a lonely tree, or bush, or something and it made you wonder what they were planning on doing, that something ended it... <br/>It''s an intriguing title for a shot.  Really makes the viewer wonder.  <br/>I think that without the title, the shot wouldn''t do as well.</td>', 'Reminds me of Ft. Sill, in the back areas where they were fenced off.  You would see a lonely tree, or bush, or something and it made you wonder what they were planning on doing, that something ended it... It''s an intriguing title for a shot.  Really makes the viewer wonder.  I think that without the title, the shot wouldn''t do as well.', '2012-03-02 11:49:52.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6698069, 1000252, 134859, '<td valign="top">A very beautiful shot.  Love the way the bridge is lit.  The angle so that some of the grassy knoll is in the shot works great.  Well done.</td>', 'A very beautiful shot.  Love the way the bridge is lit.  The angle so that some of the grassy knoll is in the shot works great.  Well done.', '2012-03-02 11:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698076, 998790, 134859, '<td valign="top">I love dams.  They are so interesting.  Some of my fondest memories is going to Lake Fontana and going to the dam.  It''s beautiful there.  I really like this shot.  The colors are wonderful, the flowing water is beautiful.  Great job</td>', 'I love dams.  They are so interesting.  Some of my fondest memories is going to Lake Fontana and going to the dam.  It''s beautiful there.  I really like this shot.  The colors are wonderful, the flowing water is beautiful.  Great job', '2012-03-02 11:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698078, 1000049, 134859, '<td valign="top">This is a very serene area from the looks of it... but I don''t think the picture is doing it justice.  There is something off about it, IMO.  I am not sure what it is, perhaps the angle chosen?  I don''t know.  But it is still very nice.</td>', 'This is a very serene area from the looks of it... but I don''t think the picture is doing it justice.  There is something off about it, IMO.  I am not sure what it is, perhaps the angle chosen?  I don''t know.  But it is still very nice.', '2012-03-02 11:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698079, 1000396, 134859, '<td valign="top">I love the shot.  The colors of the sky are amazing.  The boats in the foreground add that little extra detail, it tells a story.  It''s almost as if the boats are longing to get back in the water.  Beautiful.</td>', 'I love the shot.  The colors of the sky are amazing.  The boats in the foreground add that little extra detail, it tells a story.  It''s almost as if the boats are longing to get back in the water.  Beautiful.', '2012-03-02 11:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698081, 1001765, 134859, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice shot... but it almost looks fake... like the water and sky are a backdrop.  Perhaps its because theres so much detail in the foreground, or the angle chosen for the shot.  I can''t quite put my finger on it.</td>', 'It''s a nice shot... but it almost looks fake... like the water and sky are a backdrop.  Perhaps its because theres so much detail in the foreground, or the angle chosen for the shot.  I can''t quite put my finger on it.', '2012-03-02 11:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698086, 1001419, 134859, '<td valign="top">A definite stand out in the photo.  It seems that while there isn''t a lot in the photo, there is... like it''s too busy.  <br/>That being said, I still enjoy the shot, the people far in the background, the white trees, and the fence.  The shadow to the right is a little out of place, but overall it''s a nice shot.</td>', 'A definite stand out in the photo.  It seems that while there isn''t a lot in the photo, there is... like it''s too busy.  That being said, I still enjoy the shot, the people far in the background, the white trees, and the fence.  The shadow to the right is a little out of place, but overall it''s a nice shot.', '2012-03-02 11:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698091, 1000404, 134859, '<td valign="top">I think the rock in the front throws the balance off in the shot, IMO.  I like the idea, and the colors.  The rock is just throwing me off.</td>', 'I think the rock in the front throws the balance off in the shot, IMO.  I like the idea, and the colors.  The rock is just throwing me off.', '2012-03-02 11:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698096, 1000707, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love the pastel colors in the shot.  The bridge to the right is a nice way to compose the photo.  I think it was well shot.</td>', 'Love the pastel colors in the shot.  The bridge to the right is a nice way to compose the photo.  I think it was well shot.', '2012-03-02 12:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698100, 1001169, 134859, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice shot.  A little simplistic, but it works with the cage being the subject for focus.</td>', 'It''s a nice shot.  A little simplistic, but it works with the cage being the subject for focus.', '2012-03-02 12:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698105, 1000688, 134859, '<td valign="top">IMO, this shot is a little noisy.  It''s not clear enough for my liking.  But I think with a few adjustments, it could jump off the page.</td>', 'IMO, this shot is a little noisy.  It''s not clear enough for my liking.  But I think with a few adjustments, it could jump off the page.', '2012-03-02 12:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698106, 997642, 134859, '<td valign="top">I always like to see sun shine through bare trees.  It makes for something interesting.  I think that if the tree wasn''t so centered, it would have made the shot more appealing (to me), but overall, it''s a good shot.</td>', 'I always like to see sun shine through bare trees.  It makes for something interesting.  I think that if the tree wasn''t so centered, it would have made the shot more appealing (to me), but overall, it''s a good shot.', '2012-03-02 12:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698109, 998844, 134859, '<td valign="top">A nice city shot.  A little over processed in my opinion. But still a nice composure.</td>', 'A nice city shot.  A little over processed in my opinion. But still a nice composure.', '2012-03-02 12:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698110, 1001615, 134859, '<td valign="top">The coloring is a little odd to me, and there is something throwing the shot off.  maybe it''s the boats in the background, or the angle of the shot?  I like the idea of it, however.</td>', 'The coloring is a little odd to me, and there is something throwing the shot off.  maybe it''s the boats in the background, or the angle of the shot?  I like the idea of it, however.', '2012-03-02 12:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698113, 998507, 134859, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colors.  The blues and pinks and purples work very well in this photo.  Love the cityscape, the ferris wheel... it makes it a very interesting photo to look at!</td>', 'Gorgeous colors.  The blues and pinks and purples work very well in this photo.  Love the cityscape, the ferris wheel... it makes it a very interesting photo to look at!', '2012-03-02 12:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698114, 1001056, 134859, '<td valign="top">I always love to see pictures of trees, especially when they are barren, and even more so when they are snow covered.  Great choice in making it a black and white.  And great focus.  Love the shot</td>', 'I always love to see pictures of trees, especially when they are barren, and even more so when they are snow covered.  Great choice in making it a black and white.  And great focus.  Love the shot', '2012-03-02 12:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698116, 1001421, 134859, '<td valign="top">I have never in my life seen anything like this before.  It''s beautiful.  Not sure what the shadows are in the foreground... but I like the shot.</td>', 'I have never in my life seen anything like this before.  It''s beautiful.  Not sure what the shadows are in the foreground... but I like the shot.', '2012-03-02 12:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698118, 1001026, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love it.  The detail, the over processing here works.  The boats filled with water.  Everything about the photo just stands out!  10</td>', 'Love it.  The detail, the over processing here works.  The boats filled with water.  Everything about the photo just stands out!  10', '2012-03-02 12:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
