(6698146, 1001318, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love the mysteriousness of the photo.  Beautiful colors, and the pitch black in the foreground offers interest.  Great job</td>', 'Love the mysteriousness of the photo.  Beautiful colors, and the pitch black in the foreground offers interest.  Great job', '2012-03-02 12:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698148, 1001720, 67841, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot!</td>', 'Gorgeous shot!', '2012-03-02 12:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698152, 1001887, 134859, '<td valign="top">I want to visit here!  I don''t have a clue where this is, but the photo makes me want to be there!  It''s gorgeous.  Perfect detail.  Love that you can tell there''s a breeze.  9</td>', 'I want to visit here!  I don''t have a clue where this is, but the photo makes me want to be there!  It''s gorgeous.  Perfect detail.  Love that you can tell there''s a breeze.  9', '2012-03-02 12:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698155, 999590, 134859, '<td valign="top">There''s some smoke stacks in Poca, WV that I want to visit, I was actually thinking about it this morning... and then seeing this picture just prompted me to move that location to the top of my list.  It''s a beautiful shot, even though smoke stacks don''t have much beauty to them.  Well done!</td>', 'There''s some smoke stacks in Poca, WV that I want to visit, I was actually thinking about it this morning... and then seeing this picture just prompted me to move that location to the top of my list.  It''s a beautiful shot, even though smoke stacks don''t have much beauty to them.  Well done!', '2012-03-02 12:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698160, 1001403, 134859, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Love the colors in the sky.  The foreground seems a touch noisy(?).  Perhaps it''s just me.  <br/>But overall, I like this very much</td>', 'Nice shot.  Love the colors in the sky.  The foreground seems a touch noisy(?).  Perhaps it''s just me.  But overall, I like this very much', '2012-03-02 12:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698164, 1001870, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love, love, love seeing shots like this.  I have wanted to find abandoned cars or trucks in the perfect place, and be able to shoot them.  Still haven''t found any.  :(<br/>Great shot.  Love the detail.  The colors work very well.</td>', 'Love, love, love seeing shots like this.  I have wanted to find abandoned cars or trucks in the perfect place, and be able to shoot them.  Still haven''t found any.  :(Great shot.  Love the detail.  The colors work very well.', '2012-03-02 12:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698166, 999154, 134859, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Lovely colors.  Nice detail.  The sunlight is hitting at a perfect angle.  8</td>', 'Beautiful.  Lovely colors.  Nice detail.  The sunlight is hitting at a perfect angle.  8', '2012-03-02 12:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698168, 1000323, 134859, '<td valign="top">Wow.  I adore this shot!  The detail is impeccable.  The black and white really makes it stand out.  The angles of the buildings.  Everything just works!  10</td>', 'Wow.  I adore this shot!  The detail is impeccable.  The black and white really makes it stand out.  The angles of the buildings.  Everything just works!  10', '2012-03-02 12:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698170, 1001744, 134859, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and movement of the water.  The angles of the posts are odd, but add interest.  Nice shot.</td>', 'I love the colors and movement of the water.  The angles of the posts are odd, but add interest.  Nice shot.', '2012-03-02 12:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698171, 999467, 134859, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the morning sun.  Love the bridge and the people give a real feeling.  Very nice shot.</td>', 'Nice capture of the morning sun.  Love the bridge and the people give a real feeling.  Very nice shot.', '2012-03-02 12:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698174, 1001212, 134859, '<td valign="top">Absolutely amazing.  I wish to be able to photograph and process like this.  Seeing pictures like this inspire me that much more!  I love the angle.  The red fencing in to the right is amazing.  The path makes me want to go for a walk.  10!!!</td>', 'Absolutely amazing.  I wish to be able to photograph and process like this.  Seeing pictures like this inspire me that much more!  I love the angle.  The red fencing in to the right is amazing.  The path makes me want to go for a walk.  10!!!', '2012-03-02 12:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698179, 1001760, 134859, '<td valign="top">A little too much processing in my opinion.  I would have loved to have seen the picture without the people, though I am sure that would be difficult to do, as it looks like an amazing place to visit.  Looks like the guy in front of the rock is taking pictures also!  I think with a little less processing, the picture would have been better.  Just a thought.  Great job though</td>', 'A little too much processing in my opinion.  I would have loved to have seen the picture without the people, though I am sure that would be difficult to do, as it looks like an amazing place to visit.  Looks like the guy in front of the rock is taking pictures also!  I think with a little less processing, the picture would have been better.  Just a thought.  Great job though', '2012-03-02 12:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698180, 1001731, 67841, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene!</td>', 'Beautiful scene!', '2012-03-02 12:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698181, 1001731, 134859, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!  Very icy feeling.  Very cold.  Love the shades of blue.  The attention to detail is magnificent.  I love it!!!  9</td>', 'Gorgeous!  Very icy feeling.  Very cold.  Love the shades of blue.  The attention to detail is magnificent.  I love it!!!  9', '2012-03-02 12:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6698182, 998844, 67841, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2012-03-02 12:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
