(6698373, 998367, 85430, '<td valign="top">I never really have the right skills to take sports photos. I find it difficult to frame moving subjects correctly. Focus is also tough. The actions usually happen much faster than i can set the correct exposure. If i try to submit a sports photo in DPC, i will probably get hammered down in comments and votes. My final score would probably land below 5, and i think i would agree. Your entry is not much different from my own sports photos. So having said that, please do not be upset if i gave your entry a score below 5.</td>', 'I never really have the right skills to take sports photos. I find it difficult to frame moving subjects correctly. Focus is also tough. The actions usually happen much faster than i can set the correct exposure. If i try to submit a sports photo in DPC, i will probably get hammered down in comments and votes. My final score would probably land below 5, and i think i would agree. Your entry is not much different from my own sports photos. So having said that, please do not be upset if i gave your entry a score below 5.', '2012-03-02 13:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
