(6700402, 1001692, 25190, '<td valign="top">I think a better time of day with these shot are either early morning or evening the sun tends too be too harsh and has too much glare take a longer exposure  and give the water some effect</td>', 'I think a better time of day with these shot are either early morning or evening the sun tends too be too harsh and has too much glare take a longer exposure  and give the water some effect', '2012-03-05 06:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6700405, 1001306, 115626, '<td valign="top">This stirred up so much emotion. I feel so sad for her.</td>', 'This stirred up so much emotion. I feel so sad for her.', '2012-03-05 06:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6700547, 1001870, 104230, '<td valign="top">I like the textures and shapes here, but this has the look of an HDR processed image where "all" the contrast and interesting light has been "sucked out" of the picture by overuse of that process to the whole picture when only part needed it. My suspicion is that you applied HDR processing in order to show the details of the car''s interior, which is great.  It adds to the picture''s interest.  But having done that it would have worked better IMO if you had created a mask for the HDR layer and controlled what areas it was applied to.  In effect I think this picture calls for somewhat different processing to be applied to the car''s interior, the rest of the car, then to the rest of the image.</td>', 'I like the textures and shapes here, but this has the look of an HDR processed image where "all" the contrast and interesting light has been "sucked out" of the picture by overuse of that process to the whole picture when only part needed it. My suspicion is that you applied HDR processing in order to show the details of the car''s interior, which is great.  It adds to the picture''s interest.  But having done that it would have worked better IMO if you had created a mask for the HDR layer and controlled what areas it was applied to.  In effect I think this picture calls for somewhat different processing to be applied to the car''s interior, the rest of the car, then to the rest of the image.', '2012-03-05 11:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6700553, 1001869, 104230, '<td valign="top">Lovely light, lines, and textures. Love how the body glows.</td>', 'Lovely light, lines, and textures. Love how the body glows.', '2012-03-05 11:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6700556, 1001539, 104230, '<td valign="top">Fun shot, but not the best lighting.  It might "pop" a bit more with more light on the front of the car.</td>', 'Fun shot, but not the best lighting.  It might "pop" a bit more with more light on the front of the car.', '2012-03-05 11:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6700559, 1001868, 104230, '<td valign="top">Nice lines and reflections, but the processing is rather over the top for my taste.</td>', 'Nice lines and reflections, but the processing is rather over the top for my taste.', '2012-03-05 11:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6700599, 999289, 68020, '<td valign="top">very cool!! 10 and a fav! :-)</td>', 'very cool!! 10 and a fav! :-)', '2012-03-05 12:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6700600, 1001056, 68020, '<td valign="top">love this! 10!!</td>', 'love this! 10!!', '2012-03-05 12:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6700622, 1001731, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wonderful. The tracks add a sense of humanity and desolation to this scene.</td>', 'Wonderful. The tracks add a sense of humanity and desolation to this scene.', '2012-03-05 12:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6700626, 1001769, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very nicely photographed. The parent looks tired. As a new father, I can relate :)<br/> <br/>I may have chosen a tighter crop. The square crop leads this photo to be a bit unbalanced, in my view.</td>', 'Very nicely photographed. The parent looks tired. As a new father, I can relate :) I may have chosen a tighter crop. The square crop leads this photo to be a bit unbalanced, in my view.', '2012-03-05 12:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6700628, 999725, 114225, '<td valign="top">The gradients in this scene are magnificent. The bright yellow dress compliments the yellow from the sun on the right of the photo perfectly.</td>', 'The gradients in this scene are magnificent. The bright yellow dress compliments the yellow from the sun on the right of the photo perfectly.', '2012-03-05 12:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6700629, 999847, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice. I took a photo similar to this a few weeks ago that I''m also proud of. The was the shadows interact with the texture of the snow is what I really like.</td>', 'Nice. I took a photo similar to this a few weeks ago that I''m also proud of. The was the shadows interact with the texture of the snow is what I really like.', '2012-03-05 12:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6700631, 1000662, 114225, '<td valign="top">Overall, a good start to a car add style photo. I have some suggestions that may help you improve it (at least in my mind)<br/>* Clone out those power lines. It would also be good to de-vignette (your lens has a slight amount of vignette in the corners.<br/>* The car is really dark. Dodging it a bit would help. You really want that thing to shine<br/>* Remove the license plate. The yellow is out of place.<br/> <br/>Hope this helps.</td>', 'Overall, a good start to a car add style photo. I have some suggestions that may help you improve it (at least in my mind)* Clone out those power lines. It would also be good to de-vignette (your lens has a slight amount of vignette in the corners.* The car is really dark. Dodging it a bit would help. You really want that thing to shine* Remove the license plate. The yellow is out of place. Hope this helps.', '2012-03-05 12:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6700632, 1001851, 114225, '<td valign="top">Lovely. The colors are what really turn this photo up a notch.</td>', 'Lovely. The colors are what really turn this photo up a notch.', '2012-03-05 12:37:16.000000', NULL, 1);
