(6700683, 1001547, 83313, '<td valign="top">Grog out late with Thag, Kron &amp; Ugggg celebrating hunt. Grog forget favorite female''s day-of-borning. Grog asks <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=96751" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Guurl</a> for advising of how to make female un-mad at Grog. Guurl say for Grog to bring flowers. Make no sense to Grog. Flowers not praktikkal like <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1000470" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">fire stick</a> or sharp new weapon. Grog find empty container from drinking and pick flowers from tree on way back to cave. Female still mad...</td>', 'Grog out late with Thag, Kron & Ugggg celebrating hunt. Grog forget favorite female''s day-of-borning. Grog asks Guurl for advising of how to make female un-mad at Grog. Guurl say for Grog to bring flowers. Make no sense to Grog. Flowers not praktikkal like fire stick or sharp new weapon. Grog find empty container from drinking and pick flowers from tree on way back to cave. Female still mad...', '2012-03-05 13:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
