(6700700, 1001797, 54446, '<td valign="top">As a photo, it''s not terribly interesting.  But, I do get the metaphorical meaning and it''s an important message... symbolic of a lot of what is wrong in society.  I can read racism and bigotry into this image without any problem.  So, while the image is technically good, I think it needs another element of interest to really punch home the intended message.</td>', 'As a photo, it''s not terribly interesting.  But, I do get the metaphorical meaning and it''s an important message... symbolic of a lot of what is wrong in society.  I can read racism and bigotry into this image without any problem.  So, while the image is technically good, I think it needs another element of interest to really punch home the intended message.', '2012-03-05 14:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
