(6701839, 1001868, 101256, '<td valign="top">I''m not a huge fan of HDR images as I believe they can, and often are, overdone.  However, in some cases, the intersection of art and image combine in a synergy of light and color that is very appealing. This is one of those circumstances.  Well done.  Not sure where this will place, but it deserves a top five finish.  I don''t think it will appeal to enough voters to win, but it should place very high.</td>', 'I''m not a huge fan of HDR images as I believe they can, and often are, overdone.  However, in some cases, the intersection of art and image combine in a synergy of light and color that is very appealing. This is one of those circumstances.  Well done.  Not sure where this will place, but it deserves a top five finish.  I don''t think it will appeal to enough voters to win, but it should place very high.', '2012-03-06 17:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6701840, 1000950, 101256, '<td valign="top">This is pretty cool if only because of the white blooms on the light - not overdone at all and just on the edge providing a very nice artistic touch to the image. Again, not a huge fan of HDR, but the tones and color are very pleasing.</td>', 'This is pretty cool if only because of the white blooms on the light - not overdone at all and just on the edge providing a very nice artistic touch to the image. Again, not a huge fan of HDR, but the tones and color are very pleasing.', '2012-03-06 17:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
