(6702143, 1001619, 83313, '<td valign="top">Had a truck like this near me, with a tree growing up through it. I was looking forward to getting a shot like this one day, but they removed the truck when it was still a sapling.</td>', 'Had a truck like this near me, with a tree growing up through it. I was looking forward to getting a shot like this one day, but they removed the truck when it was still a sapling.', '2012-03-06 23:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6702144, 1000141, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene with much to look at and linger over. The bottom half invokes Breughel, but the image as a whole is something else.</td>', 'Beautiful scene with much to look at and linger over. The bottom half invokes Breughel, but the image as a whole is something else.', '2012-03-06 23:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6702147, 1000768, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image! The border works well.</td>', 'Beautiful image! The border works well.', '2012-03-07 00:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6702150, 1001794, 97225, '<td valign="top">She looks rather awkward and uncomfortable - like she might be perched up out of the way of a snake or something.</td>', 'She looks rather awkward and uncomfortable - like she might be perched up out of the way of a snake or something.', '2012-03-07 00:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6702159, 1001616, 97225, '<td valign="top">Nice sense of movement. I particularly like the shadow.</td>', 'Nice sense of movement. I particularly like the shadow.', '2012-03-07 00:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6702163, 1001826, 97225, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed - the photo and the kitty.</td>', 'Nicely composed - the photo and the kitty.', '2012-03-07 00:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6702166, 1001026, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! I love the whole image, and the details of the rings in the water, and the red bushes. 9</td>', 'Beautiful! I love the whole image, and the details of the rings in the water, and the red bushes. 9', '2012-03-07 00:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6702170, 1000009, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful study. The reflections are intriguing. Is that another child''s reflection on the right or is it a doll? And does it have its own faint reflection - a reflection of a reflection?</td>', 'Beautiful study. The reflections are intriguing. Is that another child''s reflection on the right or is it a doll? And does it have its own faint reflection - a reflection of a reflection?', '2012-03-07 00:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6702173, 1000688, 97225, '<td valign="top">Oh, such a long time since I''ve been to Terrigal. I shouldn''t have let that happen. Lovely rays coming through the clouds.</td>', 'Oh, such a long time since I''ve been to Terrigal. I shouldn''t have let that happen. Lovely rays coming through the clouds.', '2012-03-07 00:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6702178, 1001439, 97225, '<td valign="top">Oh, they are such flamboyant, over-the-top show-offs. Great capture of the detail.</td>', 'Oh, they are such flamboyant, over-the-top show-offs. Great capture of the detail.', '2012-03-07 00:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6702184, 997607, 97225, '<td valign="top">Lovely sky. There seems to be a fair bit of haloing around the rocks which detracts a bit, but I like the sense of depth.</td>', 'Lovely sky. There seems to be a fair bit of haloing around the rocks which detracts a bit, but I like the sense of depth.', '2012-03-07 00:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6702191, 1001426, 97225, '<td valign="top">Nice but it seems a tad washed out. I feel t could benefit a little from an increase in contrast and/or saturation.</td>', 'Nice but it seems a tad washed out. I feel t could benefit a little from an increase in contrast and/or saturation.', '2012-03-07 00:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6702199, 1000766, 97225, '<td valign="top">Charming! Interesting how the bubble seems to have a double surface.</td>', 'Charming! Interesting how the bubble seems to have a double surface.', '2012-03-07 00:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6702259, 1001343, 108580, '<td valign="top">They don''t sit still do they at that age? Contemplative and narrative image. 7</td>', 'They don''t sit still do they at that age? Contemplative and narrative image. 7', '2012-03-07 00:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6702267, 1001731, 108580, '<td valign="top">Despite what the greens are chanting, Earth is inexorably heading toward it''s next ice age. We are simply getting further from the sun on our egg shaped orbit and axial tilt. You can''t argue that away or hide it with fake stats and emotional arguments. <br/>Great image and compo, where the tire tracks lead me in to the image, exploring and enjoying. Love the distant minimal horison and whispy sky.</td>', 'Despite what the greens are chanting, Earth is inexorably heading toward it''s next ice age. We are simply getting further from the sun on our egg shaped orbit and axial tilt. You can''t argue that away or hide it with fake stats and emotional arguments. Great image and compo, where the tire tracks lead me in to the image, exploring and enjoying. Love the distant minimal horison and whispy sky.', '2012-03-07 00:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6702287, 1001585, 110108, '<td valign="top">very interesting picture, use of silhouette is excellent.<br/>I would love to see if you had cropped on the left guy &amp; the glass wall ( without ceiling )</td>', 'very interesting picture, use of silhouette is excellent.I would love to see if you had cropped on the left guy & the glass wall ( without ceiling )', '2012-03-07 01:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
