(6702456, 1001183, 108069, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely fantastic: 10<br/> <br/>Edit: I think what makes it so powerful is all the negative space, which must be nearly half, so score is now 5.<br/> <br/>Edit 2: It''s probably closer to 40%, so 4.<br/> <br/>Edit 3: Why didn''t you use more negative space? 3</td>', 'This is absolutely fantastic: 10 Edit: I think what makes it so powerful is all the negative space, which must be nearly half, so score is now 5. Edit 2: It''s probably closer to 40%, so 4. Edit 3: Why didn''t you use more negative space? 3', '2012-03-07 03:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6702459, 1001585, 28742, '<td valign="top">How much ya wanna bet they are talking to <i>each other</i>? :P</td>', 'How much ya wanna bet they are talking to each other? :P', '2012-03-07 03:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
