(6702469, 999784, 28742, '<td valign="top">O-M-G - I am kinda freaked out - I am listening to that song which came on right before I clicked onto this image. Seriously. Very weird. It didn''t even hit me until I scored this and moved to the next image and then I had to go back. Now I am compelled to bump this up a point. :)</td>', 'O-M-G - I am kinda freaked out - I am listening to that song which came on right before I clicked onto this image. Seriously. Very weird. It didn''t even hit me until I scored this and moved to the next image and then I had to go back. Now I am compelled to bump this up a point. :)', '2012-03-07 04:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6702479, 999590, 108069, '<td valign="top">I love this photo. I''ve come back to it over and over. Would I change a thing here and there? Yeah, I would. But that''s not for me to do or say. It''s awesome as it is and thanks for sharing.</td>', 'I love this photo. I''ve come back to it over and over. Would I change a thing here and there? Yeah, I would. But that''s not for me to do or say. It''s awesome as it is and thanks for sharing.', '2012-03-07 04:17:44.000000', NULL, 1);
