(6702916, 1000426, 83313, '<td valign="top">I was going to slap a quick 5 on this, but I stopped and considered why you entered a photo of other photographers instead of the dramatic wildfire. It then made a point with me about looking at a disaster as a photo op. Not sure if that''s a terrible thing, since it''s happening anyway, but it made me pause and think. Making me pause and think is always worth extra pointage. Good documentary photography and an example of looking at things a little differently.</td>', 'I was going to slap a quick 5 on this, but I stopped and considered why you entered a photo of other photographers instead of the dramatic wildfire. It then made a point with me about looking at a disaster as a photo op. Not sure if that''s a terrible thing, since it''s happening anyway, but it made me pause and think. Making me pause and think is always worth extra pointage. Good documentary photography and an example of looking at things a little differently.', '2012-03-07 13:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6702932, 1001686, 83313, '<td valign="top">Grog discovers <strike>agriculchur</strike> <strike>agrekulc</strike> <strike>aggie culture</strike> raising animals for food instead of hunting. Grog gets fat and lazy. Females complain that Grog is already Grate, but too much of grateness makes Grog slow and un-fun after dark. Grog invents wheel and then invents fast thing on wheels to get unfat.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1001214" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1001214.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1001214.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1001214.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Is all history youngling needs to know.</td>', 'Grog discovers agriculchur agrekulc aggie culture raising animals for food instead of hunting. Grog gets fat and lazy. Females complain that Grog is already Grate, but too much of grateness makes Grog slow and un-fun after dark. Grog invents wheel and then invents fast thing on wheels to get unfat.  Is all history youngling needs to know.', '2012-03-07 13:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
