(6702965, 999322, 108580, '<td valign="top">Wow. Awesome lighting (barring her left cheek area; good but perhaps subtle reflected light there would not go amiss), fabulous skin tone, helped by a redheads'' generally fairer complexion, and more light emphasis on her upper half than on the hands, lower half; deliberate? Makes me focus on upper and away form hands. Mad period style costume. Which brings me to the floral motif bra. Sadly I think it''s out of place with the Elizabethan/Victorian slant. However I can stare at this image and your classy models engagement for hours. 8.<br/> <br/>Johanna if this is yours, understand I am in no way pulling your (or whomever) image to pieces. I am in awe of professional portraiture and am nowhere near pulling off this quality of work. This is merely my way of embedding knowledge in my thick portraiture skull and I hope it will guide me at my next attempt.</td>', 'Wow. Awesome lighting (barring her left cheek area; good but perhaps subtle reflected light there would not go amiss), fabulous skin tone, helped by a redheads'' generally fairer complexion, and more light emphasis on her upper half than on the hands, lower half; deliberate? Makes me focus on upper and away form hands. Mad period style costume. Which brings me to the floral motif bra. Sadly I think it''s out of place with the Elizabethan/Victorian slant. However I can stare at this image and your classy models engagement for hours. 8. Johanna if this is yours, understand I am in no way pulling your (or whomever) image to pieces. I am in awe of professional portraiture and am nowhere near pulling off this quality of work. This is merely my way of embedding knowledge in my thick portraiture skull and I hope it will guide me at my next attempt.', '2012-03-07 14:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
