(6702979, 999289, 138630, '<td valign="top">I love the colors in this unusual (to me) winter seascape and the clarity is excellent.  The composition which I initially found too divided in half has grown on me.  One of my top scorers.</td>', 'I love the colors in this unusual (to me) winter seascape and the clarity is excellent.  The composition which I initially found too divided in half has grown on me.  One of my top scorers.', '2012-03-07 14:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
