(6703023, 1001429, 56828, '<td valign="top">I''m not normally one for doing this but your title knocked this down 1 point simply because it made me realized that the subject of your photo wasn''t intended to be.  The headstone for TU Bussy is the central focus and every other headstone, the degree of focus, and lighting all lead you there.  It is still a great photo though.</td>', 'I''m not normally one for doing this but your title knocked this down 1 point simply because it made me realized that the subject of your photo wasn''t intended to be.  The headstone for TU Bussy is the central focus and every other headstone, the degree of focus, and lighting all lead you there.  It is still a great photo though.', '2012-03-07 15:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
