(6703214, 1001763, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Bizarre, bizarre, bizarre! And no bad thing! Daylight and door frames and scorched parchment paper. A novel abstraction to be sure.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: More confounding than interesting<br/> <br/>Overall: Bold, but for me, not too satisfying.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Bizarre, bizarre, bizarre! And no bad thing! Daylight and door frames and scorched parchment paper. A novel abstraction to be sure. Critical stuff: More confounding than interesting Overall: Bold, but for me, not too satisfying.', '2012-03-07 16:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703216, 1001813, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: I really like the smoothness of this image. I also really like how it''s difficult to tell whether the scene or the image is black and white. I really like your overall composition too and the slight vignette adds much.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: not much at all<br/> <br/>Overall: Beautifully presentation of  sublime scene.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: I really like the smoothness of this image. I also really like how it''s difficult to tell whether the scene or the image is black and white. I really like your overall composition too and the slight vignette adds much. Critical stuff: not much at all Overall: Beautifully presentation of  sublime scene.', '2012-03-07 16:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
