(6703235, 1001878, 164, '<td valign="top">not sure</td>', 'not sure', '2012-03-07 17:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703240, 1001837, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: A very unusual presentation that has the effect of a composite (though I know it is''t). The muted coloration works really well and the overall bizarreness is quite compelling.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Interesting though it is; I remain unconvinced that the overall effect works.<br/> <br/>Overall: Thought provoking and fantastically well executed.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: A very unusual presentation that has the effect of a composite (though I know it is''t). The muted coloration works really well and the overall bizarreness is quite compelling. Critical stuff: Interesting though it is; I remain unconvinced that the overall effect works. Overall: Thought provoking and fantastically well executed.', '2012-03-07 17:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703243, 1000976, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Signature soft glowing but sharp toning that has the perfect measure of the scene. A really interesting character and a most interesting backdrop. You really are master of the light though.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nothing<br/> <br/>Overall: Masterful.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Signature soft glowing but sharp toning that has the perfect measure of the scene. A really interesting character and a most interesting backdrop. You really are master of the light though. Critical stuff: Nothing Overall: Masterful.', '2012-03-07 17:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703245, 1001585, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Gorgeous coloration and a really interesting scene. Although the figures take centre stage, I find that tree behind the glass the most compelling element. This silhouette presentation should look flat but you''ve managed to capture/represent the light in a way that maintains the depth of the scene. I love that texture on the foreground floor.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nothing at all<br/> <br/>Overall: Magnificently constructed image.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Gorgeous coloration and a really interesting scene. Although the figures take centre stage, I find that tree behind the glass the most compelling element. This silhouette presentation should look flat but you''ve managed to capture/represent the light in a way that maintains the depth of the scene. I love that texture on the foreground floor. Critical stuff: Nothing at all Overall: Magnificently constructed image.', '2012-03-07 17:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703248, 1001280, 97225, '<td valign="top">Lovely!</td>', 'Lovely!', '2012-03-07 17:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703249, 1001864, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautifully soft and delicate.</td>', 'Beautifully soft and delicate.', '2012-03-07 17:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703251, 1001802, 97225, '<td valign="top">I love those quirky reflections!</td>', 'I love those quirky reflections!', '2012-03-07 17:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703253, 999825, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Extraordinarily minimalist image - I appreciate the vast negative space. Somehow you''ve managed to make me witness to an alien abduction - I like that image. The suggestion of a train tack going into the light makes the image feel slightly dangerous.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Not really but clearly this isn''t going to appeal to everybody.<br/> <br/>Overall: I like it!</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Extraordinarily minimalist image - I appreciate the vast negative space. Somehow you''ve managed to make me witness to an alien abduction - I like that image. The suggestion of a train tack going into the light makes the image feel slightly dangerous. Critical stuff: Not really but clearly this isn''t going to appeal to everybody. Overall: I like it!', '2012-03-07 17:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703254, 997854, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Fabulous light, beautifully captured. Excellent clarity of image and purity of moment. Evidence that sometimes less is more. I really enjoy this cinematic palette too. I like the height you''ve given your image - plenty of (literal) headroom.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nothing<br/> <br/>Overall: Really excellent image.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Fabulous light, beautifully captured. Excellent clarity of image and purity of moment. Evidence that sometimes less is more. I really enjoy this cinematic palette too. I like the height you''ve given your image - plenty of (literal) headroom. Critical stuff: Nothing Overall: Really excellent image.', '2012-03-07 17:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703256, 1001821, 97225, '<td valign="top">Oh, what opulence! Lots to look at and hold interest here. It took me a while to figure out that the orangy car has a green back, and that the apparent appearance of a stray green car in the reflections is accounted for. (Excuse my low resolution eyes!)</td>', 'Oh, what opulence! Lots to look at and hold interest here. It took me a while to figure out that the orangy car has a green back, and that the apparent appearance of a stray green car in the reflections is accounted for. (Excuse my low resolution eyes!)', '2012-03-07 17:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703259, 1001421, 97225, '<td valign="top">Oh, wow! Great capture.</td>', 'Oh, wow! Great capture.', '2012-03-07 17:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703260, 1001892, 97225, '<td valign="top">Nice - I love the little rings around the seagull.</td>', 'Nice - I love the little rings around the seagull.', '2012-03-07 17:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703262, 1001622, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Wonderful muted coloration and standout composition of a compelling scene. It may have been tempting to get closer and focus on the figures; but focussing on the barrier and distancing yourself from the figures has really paid dividends. A long look really rewards and the various leading lines begin to overlay a really strong sense of structure to the composition.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nothing really<br/> <br/>Overall: A sleeper this one - get''s better the longer you stay.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Wonderful muted coloration and standout composition of a compelling scene. It may have been tempting to get closer and focus on the figures; but focussing on the barrier and distancing yourself from the figures has really paid dividends. A long look really rewards and the various leading lines begin to overlay a really strong sense of structure to the composition. Critical stuff: Nothing really Overall: A sleeper this one - get''s better the longer you stay.', '2012-03-07 17:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
