(6703271, 998344, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Standout contrast and a really unusual composition - I find this really compelling and highly effective. I''d normally shy away from such extreme highlights and adjacent shadows but you were absolutely right to embrace them.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nope<br/> <br/>Overall: Outstanding image.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Standout contrast and a really unusual composition - I find this really compelling and highly effective. I''d normally shy away from such extreme highlights and adjacent shadows but you were absolutely right to embrace them. Critical stuff: Nope Overall: Outstanding image.', '2012-03-07 17:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
