(6703754, 1001494, 142483, '<td valign="top">wow, you are on fire!! you''re inspiring for a (almost) 15 year old, thats for sure! Amazing photo, one of my highest rated. Can''t believe you just score 4 PB''s in a row! Guess your next challenge will be a blue ribbon?? Nice work Nicky<br/> <br/>EDIT: That should be "inspiring especially since you''re a 15 year old", because you''re inspiring regardless of age, but that''s just an extra kicker. You have a bright future ahead of you<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-03-08 00:31:43.</i></td>', 'wow, you are on fire!! you''re inspiring for a (almost) 15 year old, thats for sure! Amazing photo, one of my highest rated. Can''t believe you just score 4 PB''s in a row! Guess your next challenge will be a blue ribbon?? Nice work Nicky EDIT: That should be "inspiring especially since you''re a 15 year old", because you''re inspiring regardless of age, but that''s just an extra kicker. You have a bright future ahead of you', '2012-03-08 00:14:35.000000', '2012-03-08 00:31:43.000000', 0),
(6703755, 1001026, 68504, '<td valign="top">you have a great gift.</td>', 'you have a great gift.', '2012-03-08 00:15:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(6703756, 1001494, 60173, '<td valign="top">You''re out of control!</td>', 'You''re out of control!', '2012-03-08 00:16:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(6703758, 1001590, 108580, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by PennyClick:</b></div><hr/><i> But the image does not seem to be horizontal, which is a shame.</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks Penny for the advice! The pitch is all over the place and sloping to the right. I was on a tripod, level. The wickets were not placed vertical either. So overall it''s an illusion but still a valid comment. I''ll keep that in mind in future.</td>', 'Originally posted by PennyClick: But the image does not seem to be horizontal, which is a shame.  Thanks Penny for the advice! The pitch is all over the place and sloping to the right. I was on a tripod, level. The wickets were not placed vertical either. So overall it''s an illusion but still a valid comment. I''ll keep that in mind in future.', '2012-03-08 00:16:42.000000', NULL, 0),
