(6704037, 997854, 53147, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by NiallOTuama:</b></div><hr/><i> I like the picture in this. Funny thing is that it makes me think of the transience of time, and your kid''s only a kid!<br/> <br/>What''s he reading? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>He was reading a math book called "The Life of Fred". He really got into it. And the spread between now and the image above is right around 3 and a half years. I go back through my portfolio every so often and it''s cool to see the growth of my kiddos captured throughout the challenges. Unsettling at times but cool none the less.</td>', 'Originally posted by NiallOTuama: I like the picture in this. Funny thing is that it makes me think of the transience of time, and your kid''s only a kid! What''s he reading?  He was reading a math book called "The Life of Fred". He really got into it. And the spread between now and the image above is right around 3 and a half years. I go back through my portfolio every so often and it''s cool to see the growth of my kiddos captured throughout the challenges. Unsettling at times but cool none the less.', '2012-03-08 05:25:17.000000', NULL, 0),
