(6704066, 1000783, 44971, '<td valign="top">In the beginning of February, the Black Sea in Constanta was prety much white. The day the photo was taken was rather warm (around 5 degrees C), however, the days before the temperatures dropped to minus 20 degrees C. What you see is the water was covered by a thick layer of ice having the consistency of iced smoothie.<br/>Other pictures taken that day: <a href="//ionutus.500px.com/outside/#/0" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//ionutus.500px.com/outside/#/0</a> <br/></td>', 'In the beginning of February, the Black Sea in Constanta was prety much white. The day the photo was taken was rather warm (around 5 degrees C), however, the days before the temperatures dropped to minus 20 degrees C. What you see is the water was covered by a thick layer of ice having the consistency of iced smoothie.Other pictures taken that day: //ionutus.500px.com/outside/#/0 ', '2012-03-08 06:18:14.000000', NULL, 0),
