(6704365, 999289, 83650, '<td valign="top">My first gut instinct said this was probably near pictured rocks.  It looks just like one of the many little inlets along the shoreline.  If you ever head back up there and wouldn''t mind some company, I''d love to meet up and visit some hidden spots - as you seem to know where the picturesque areas are.  Besides, motorcycle season is just about here and I wanted to do a photo tour in the UP this spring.  :-)  Oh, and of course, congrats on the blue!</td>', 'My first gut instinct said this was probably near pictured rocks.  It looks just like one of the many little inlets along the shoreline.  If you ever head back up there and wouldn''t mind some company, I''d love to meet up and visit some hidden spots - as you seem to know where the picturesque areas are.  Besides, motorcycle season is just about here and I wanted to do a photo tour in the UP this spring.  :-)  Oh, and of course, congrats on the blue!', '2012-03-08 13:00:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(6704367, 1001671, 30861, '<td valign="top">I figured this was yours. Very difficult to capture "the way" clouds like that feel in the mountains, and you''ve done it perfectly. I''d have expected a somewhat higher finish from this, but so it goes. Nice work!</td>', 'I figured this was yours. Very difficult to capture "the way" clouds like that feel in the mountains, and you''ve done it perfectly. I''d have expected a somewhat higher finish from this, but so it goes. Nice work!', '2012-03-08 13:15:26.000000', NULL, 0),
